  "MegaCrit.Sts2.Core.Models.CardModel.<Affliction>k__BackingField": {
    "type": "MegaCrit.Sts2.Core.Models.AfflictionModel",
    "risk": "reference-game",
    "reason": "re-bound by CardModel.DeepCloneFields (CardModel.cs:1194-1217), which StateSnapshot.RebindDeepCloneOwnership re-invokes on the LIVE model after every CopyMutableFields — so the live model never keeps the discarded clone's copy. This is the exact mechanism that fixed CardEnergyCost._card; if the game ever drops a field from DeepCloneFields, this entry stops being true and the reason must be re-judged. Re-applied via AfflictInternal, which rebinds AfflictionModel.Card."
  },
